  "title": "",
  "body": "   Looking ahead: What should the researchers' next steps be to fix the limitations or build on this knowledge?    Answers will vary. Some suggestions are   Expand study to include males.    Monitor exercise as well.    Look at pre\/post cholesterol measurements.      "
